From c5c422674d539daf6f4749d621b2745220f9a66e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:25:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] fix(build): restore compiling master (B-10)

- Complete the require_validator refactor: add the missing field to the
  10 ToolContext literals commit f80dccb20 missed (7 in jcode-app-core,
  3 in jcode-tui, 1 in src/bin/harness.rs). Value is false, matching the
  documented backward-compatible default; daemon sessions still fail
  closed via the JCODE_COWORK_MODE checks in verify_path/resolve_path.
- Fix broken duplicated stdout/stderr/wait tail in run_bridge_cli
  (browser.rs): hoist WinJobGuard to function scope, let each platform
  block assign shared stdout/stderr/status, delete the dead duplicate
  that referenced a moved-out-of-scope `child`.

cargo check --locked -p jcode -p jcode-tool-core now passes.
